    <us-gaap:LesseeOperatingLeasesTextBlock contextRef="c-1" id="f-1072">Leases&lt;div style="margin-bottom:9pt;text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'NVIDIA Sans',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Our lease obligations primarily consist of operating leases for our data centers and offices, with lease periods expiring between fiscal years 2027 and 2075.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-bottom:9pt;text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'NVIDIA Sans',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Future minimum lease obligations under our non-cancelable lease agreements as of July&#160;26, 2026, were as follows:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="margin-bottom:9pt;margin-top:9pt;text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:79.455%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:18.345%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="background-color:#ffffff;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'NVIDIA Sans',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%"&gt;Operating Lease Obligations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="border-top:1.5pt solid #000;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'NVIDIA Sans',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:100%"&gt;(In&#160;millions)&lt;/span&gt;&lt